{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DREADMARROW is a fast-paced dungeon-crawling RPG where skills and chaos collide. Recruit heroes, conquer the deadly arena, and plunge into dungeons filled with treasure and terrifying foes. Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Massive Arsenal: Discover and equip a huge variety of weapons and armor to customize your characters.  <br><br>-13 Playable Classes: Recruit male or female heroes, each with unique abilities and combat styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Color-Tiered Loot: Hunt for rare (blue) and epic (purple) gear in true RPG fashion. Equip to hear sounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dynamic Combat: Engage in side-by-side battles packed with magic, skills, and strategic choices. <br><br>-Challenging Dungeons: Conquer sprawling levels with elevation changes and secret paths. <br><br>-Epic Raids: Team up with other recruited characters and take on the most powerful enemies. <br><br>-The Arena: Prove your worth in relentless combat against foes for arena coins (and obtaining special gear). <br><br>-Unique Deaths from Enemies: Witness unforgettable finishing blows if you get defeated by enemies.<br> <br>-Immersive World: Experience parallax backgrounds, dynamic weather, harvestable resources and a handy mini-map to guide you on your journey.   <br> <br>-Custom Original Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in music composed exclusively by Murd3rcat.  <br> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photosensitivity warning: slight use of flashing lights!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031690?t=1773807770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031690/ecdd9871a6120579a789f30e90ac293711b73770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773807770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031